NOTICE — upstream and third-party attributions
===============================================

termux-dsh builds a Termux/Android repack of dsh and patches the following
MIT-licensed projects:

- @deepseek-ai/dsh and its @deepseek-ai/dsh-* dependencies
  (https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness, MIT)
- koffi (MIT) — cross-compiled for android-arm64 from its MIT sources
- node-pty (MIT) — cross-compiled for android-arm64 from its MIT sources
- @vscode/ripgrep (MIT) — resolved at runtime to the system `rg` on Termux
- esbuild (MIT) and sharp (Apache-2.0; depends on libvips, LGPL-2.1+) —
  consumed as published npm packages, not rebuilt here

The release tarball is generated by this repository's CI from the official
@deepseek-ai/dsh npm package plus the patches described in PATCHES.md. It is
NOT the upstream dsh product and NOT the dsh-termux packaging from
sunflower2333/dsh-android; that project's artifacts are never redistributed.

Patches in patches/core/ and patches/platform/ modify files of the above
packages; each patch contains implementation changes only and does not alter
upstream licensing. See PATCHES.md for per-patch rationale and applicable
versions.
